# The image needs only the server's sources, the web UI's sources and the entrypoint.
# Everything else stays out of the build context (allow-list).
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!web/
!deploy/container/

# Build output and caches, even inside the allowed folders.
**/target/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
**/.DS_Store
